    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 Created by the ancient mystics of the Ivory Tower while they were investigating the Secrets of Infinite Flame contained in the flame stone, the Golem seemed to be a failed experiment and was discarded. Reawakened recently, it now wanders near the Ivory Tower and interferes with Spirits of Flame. Not surprisingly, it has become a major headache for the mystics. Magic Creatures Lv. 2 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Magic Creatures. P. Def. +5% Max HP +3% Received Critical Damage -10% Received M. Crit. Damage -10% Resistance to Bleed +20% Resistance to Bow +10% Resistance to Crossbow +10% Speed -5 Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% Greater Bow/Crossbow Resistance Lv. 2 Highly resistant to Bow/Crossbows. Dagger/Rapier Resistance Lv. 3 Resistant to Dagger/Rapier attacks. Blunt Weapon Vulnerability Lv. 1 Vulnerable to Blunt Weapons. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
